column69:
For the curious and/or lazy, the core of the trick is<p><pre><code>  -webkit-filter: blur(1px);
</code></pre>
plus<p><pre><code>  -webkit-transform: scale(0.9);
</code></pre>
and requisite wrapping. I'm sure I'm not the only one that just learned the former existed (and is supported!), so I thought I'd point it out.
